  "post_title": "Navideño concierto de la orquesta y el coro de la Unión Musical de Onda",
  "post_date": "2013-12-22 11:50:54",
  "post_name": "navideno-concierto-de-la-orquesta-y-el-coro-de-la-union-musical-de-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>La Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda ha ofrecido la tarde-noche de este s&aacute;bado el concierto de Navidad dentro de las fiestas de la Caja Rural. En la primera parte ha actuado la orquesta y en la segunda, el coro.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/IMG_4065.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Bajo la direcci&oacute;n de su nueva titular, Carmen M&aacute;s Arocas, la orquesta, reforzada con tres integrantes de la Orquesta Filarm&oacute;nica Mart&iacute;n i Soler de Valencia,&nbsp; ha interpretado obras de Schubert, con Irene soto Hern&aacute;ndez como concertino, Sibelius y una selecci&oacute;n de villancicos populares, que han finalizado con el gorro de Papa No&euml;l puesto.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/IMG_4106.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>En la segunda parte, Nadezhda Stoyanova ha dirigido &nbsp;al coro en un concierto de villancicos populares de Castell&oacute;n y Venezuela,&nbsp;y tambi&eacute;n de compositores como Matilde Salvador, Berlin, Smith, Bittrich y Montenegro.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4050.jpg\" alt=\"img_4050\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4051.jpg\" alt=\"img_4051\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4052.jpg\" alt=\"img_4052\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4053.jpg\" alt=\"img_4053\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4055.jpg\" alt=\"img_4055\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4056.jpg\" alt=\"img_4056\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4057.jpg\" alt=\"img_4057\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4058.jpg\" alt=\"img_4058\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4059.jpg\" alt=\"img_4059\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4060.jpg\" alt=\"img_4060\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4061.jpg\" alt=\"img_4061\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4062.jpg\" alt=\"img_4062\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4063.jpg\" alt=\"img_4063\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4064.jpg\" alt=\"img_4064\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4065.jpg\" alt=\"img_4065\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertorquestracorsumsconadal/img_4066.jpg\" alt=\"img_4066\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertor